              "value": 17
            },
            {
              "name": "dialog",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "This is the Pok\u00e9mon Lottery Corner. I'm Felicity, your\nattendant today.\nIf the drawn number matches the ID No. of any of\nyour Pok\u00e9mon, you could win fabulous gifts.\nWould you like to check today's lucky number?\nFirst, I'll look up today's Pok\u00e9mon Lottery Corner\nlucky number.\n...\nYour Loto Ticket number is .\nNow, let's see if it matches the ID No. of any of your\nPok\u00e9mon.\nI'm sorry. You didn't get a match...\nPlease do visit again.\nCongratulations!\nThe ID number of your team's  matches your\nLoto Ticket number!\nCongratulations!\nThe ID number of your PC-boxed  matches your\nLoto Ticket number!\nOh my goodness, all five digits matched!\nYou've won the jackpot prize!\nPlease do visit again! Good-bye from Felicity, your\nattendant!\nYou have no room left. Make room, then come see\nme.\nThe last four digits matched, so you win the first\nprize!\nPlease do visit again! Good-bye from Felicity, your\nattendant!\nYou have no room left. Make room, then come see\nme.\nThe last three digits matched, so you win the\nsecond prize!\nPlease do visit again! Good-bye from Felicity, your\nattendant!\nYou have no room left. Make room, then come see\nme.\nThe last two digits matched, so you win the third\nprize!\nPlease do visit again! Good-bye from Felicity, your\nattendant!\nYou have no room left. Make room, then come see\nme.\nThe last digit matched, so you win the fourth prize!\nPlease do visit again! Good-bye from Felicity, your\nattendant!\nYou have no room left. Make room, then come see\nme.\nOh, I see.Please do visit us again."
            }
          ]
