            {
              "name": "dialog",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Welcome!\nOh, you don't have a Coin Case? Here.\nYou can exchange your coins for fabulous prizes\nnext door.\nYou don't have any room for it. Come back when\nyou do.\nYou can exchange your coins for fabulous prizes\nnext door."
